{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/33_slot/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>부모 컴포넌트로부터 자식컴포넌트로 데이터를 받아오는 방법으로 props 말고 slot이 있다.<br>\nprops를 보내고 받고 사용하는 과정 없이도 직관적으로 데이터를 컴포넌트로 보낼 수 있다.</p>\n<p>slot은 데이터 바인딩을 HTML에다가 할 때 사용한다.<br>\n속성 등에는 사용할 수 없다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"slot-문법-2가지-step\" style=\"position:relative;\">slot 문법 2가지 step<a href=\"#slot-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95-2%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%80-step\" aria-label=\"slot 문법 2가지 step permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>자식 컴포넌트에서 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;slot>&lt;/slot></code> 영역 만들기</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>부모 컴포넌트에서 자식컴포넌트 사이에 입력한 자료가 slot에 들어가게 된다.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"1-자식-컴포넌트에-데이터를-받을-slotslot-영역-만들기\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 자식 컴포넌트에, 데이터를 받을 &#x3C;slot>&#x3C;/slot> 영역 만들기<a href=\"#1-%EC%9E%90%EC%8B%9D-%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8%EC%97%90-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0%EB%A5%BC-%EB%B0%9B%EC%9D%84-slotslot-%EC%98%81%EC%97%AD-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"1 자식 컴포넌트에 데이터를 받을 slotslot 영역 만들기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(FilterBox.vue)\r\n\r\n&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;filter-item&quot; :class=&quot;`${filter}`&quot; :style=&quot;{ backgroundImage : `url(${uploadImage})` }&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;slot&gt;&lt;/slot&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-부모-컴포넌트에서-자식컴포넌트-사이에-자료-입력\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 부모 컴포넌트에서 자식컴포넌트 사이에 자료 입력<a href=\"#2-%EB%B6%80%EB%AA%A8-%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EC%9E%90%EC%8B%9D%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8-%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%EC%97%90-%EC%9E%90%EB%A3%8C-%EC%9E%85%EB%A0%A5\" aria-label=\"2 부모 컴포넌트에서 자식컴포넌트 사이에 자료 입력 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(Container.vue)\r\n\r\n...\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;filters&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;ul&gt;\r\n  &lt;li class=&quot;filter-1&quot; v-for=&quot;(a,i) in filter&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;FilterBox :uploadImage=&quot;uploadImage&quot; :filter=&quot;a&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;!-- FilterBox 컴포넌트의 slot 자리에 들어갈 데이터 --&gt;\r\n      {{ a }}\r\n    &lt;/FilterBox&gt;\r\n  &lt;/li&gt;\r\n  &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n...</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"슬롯-여러-개-사용할-때\" style=\"position:relative;\">슬롯 여러 개 사용할 때<a href=\"#%EC%8A%AC%EB%A1%AF-%EC%97%AC%EB%9F%AC-%EA%B0%9C-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%A0-%EB%95%8C\" aria-label=\"슬롯 여러 개 사용할 때 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(FilterBox.vue)\r\n\r\n&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;filter-item&quot; :class=&quot;`${filter}`&quot; :style=&quot;{ backgroundImage : `url(${uploadImage})` }&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;\r\n      &lt;slot name=&quot;a&quot;&gt;&lt;/slot&gt;\r\n      &lt;slot name=&quot;b&quot;&gt;&lt;/slot&gt;\r\n    &lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(Container.vue)\r\n\r\n...\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n  &lt;li class=&quot;filter-1&quot; v-for=&quot;(a,i) in filter&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;FilterBox :uploadImage=&quot;uploadImage&quot; :filter=&quot;a&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;!-- FilterBox 컴포넌트의 slot 자리에 들어갈 데이터 --&gt;\r\n      &lt;template v-slot:a&gt;{{ a }}&lt;/template&gt;\r\n      &lt;template v-slot:b&gt;{{ i }}&lt;/template&gt;\r\n    &lt;/FilterBox&gt;\r\n  &lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n...</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#slot-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95-2%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%80-step\">slot 문법 2가지 step</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#1-%EC%9E%90%EC%8B%9D-%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8%EC%97%90-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0%EB%A5%BC-%EB%B0%9B%EC%9D%84-slotslot-%EC%98%81%EC%97%AD-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0\">1. 자식 컴포넌트에, 데이터를 받을 &#x3C;slot>&#x3C;/slot> 영역 만들기</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#2-%EB%B6%80%EB%AA%A8-%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EC%9E%90%EC%8B%9D%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8-%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%EC%97%90-%EC%9E%90%EB%A3%8C-%EC%9E%85%EB%A0%A5\">2. 부모 컴포넌트에서 자식컴포넌트 사이에 자료 입력</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%8A%AC%EB%A1%AF-%EC%97%AC%EB%9F%AC-%EA%B0%9C-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%A0-%EB%95%8C\">슬롯 여러 개 사용할 때</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"33. props 말고 slot","summary":"부모 컴포넌트로부터 자식컴포넌트로 데이터를 받아오는 방법으로 props 말고 s